      "source": [
        "@fig-wordcloud represents a word cloud of the 200 most frequent word stems in the training data. It provides an overview of important terms to look out for in the data. Obviously, `amazon` appears most often, followed by stems such as `custom` (customer/s), `deliveri` (delivery/deliveries) and `order`. Frequent terms also include `refund`, `return`, `time`, `day`, `servic`, hinting the importance of short-term deliveries and of return / refund policies. \n",
        "\n",
